     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "0/1 0/1 1/1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 emptying water where water_evaporates spends the contents without placing it" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I3
